sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant API as Chat API
    participant Hist as Conversation store
    participant Inf as Inference service
    participant GPU as GPU
    U->>API: send a message
    API->>Hist: append, then load the window
    Hist-->>API: prior turns within the context budget
    API->>Inf: prompt built from that window
    Note over API,Inf: the model is stateless — the conversation lives in your store, not in it
    Inf->>GPU: prefill the prompt
    loop each token
        GPU-->>Inf: next token
        Inf-->>U: stream over SSE
    end
    Inf->>API: finished
    API->>Hist: persist the assistant turn
    Note over U,Inf: if the stream drops, the client resumes from the stored turn
